# Local Runtime

- Do **not** start the game server or client dev server automatically. Only start them when the user explicitly asks.
- The user plays in an **external browser**. Do not open or drive the Cursor IDE browser for gameplay unless they ask.
- When the user asks to start the server or client, use the documented commands from `README.md`:
  - `yarn server` — start game server only
  - `yarn client` — start web client only
  - `yarn start` — start both together
- Deploying to Vercel or the VPS is fine when asked; that is not the same as starting a local server.
